    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49543" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρ-ωμα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>doorway</i> (including posts, sill, and lintel), <i><span class="en">
